The next two reveals are just around the corner! Tune in to HillbillyWilly's stream tomorrow, November 7, starting at 7 AM Pacific, for a first look at two more additions to Dragontopia.

And we're not stopping there! GP will round things out with the final two reveals in a special video coming to his channel on Monday, November 9.

Keep your eyes peeled, Survivors. Dragontopia still has a few secrets left to share!

